        <mxCell id="82d1D_E5-_z6WtIXFdai-1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="Hello Interview Delivery Framework&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Requirement Gathering (functional and non-functional)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. Entity extraction and API design&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Data flow (if infra heavy question)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. HLD that satisfies basic functional requirements&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;5. Deep dives into non-functional requirements&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
